* deterministic identity;
* validation.

---

## Phase 2 â€” Quantitative Infrastructure

Maintain and expand:

* Python backend;
* C++ backend;
* backend routing;
* numerical parity;
* benchmarks.

---

## Phase 3 â€” XAUUSD Research

Focus on:

* real historical XAUUSD data;
* market state;
* market memory;
* candle outcomes;
* predictive-value experiments;
